Mean VIF = 1.303, mean robust VIF = 1.235.
Rule of thumb: VIF>10 (tol<0.1) signals serious collinearity. Robust VIF (RVIF, WGM-FIMGT) is
resistant to high-leverage collinearity-enhancing obs.
Ref: Ismaeel, Midi & Sani (2021).

